jobs.description:
Are you detail-oriented and enjoy working with your hands? Do you want to be part of a global leader in logistics? Then DHL Weert is looking for you!

As a VAS Employee at DHL, you'll be responsible for performing various value-added services such as labeling, repacking, assembling promotional packages, and quality control. Your work ensures that every product leaving our warehouse meets customer-specific requirements — adding that extra touch of value that sets DHL apart.

- You are fulltime available;
- You enjoy hands-on, repetitive work and have a strong eye for detail;
- You are able to work independently and follow clear instructions;
- You have basic knowledge of English;
- Experience in logistics is a plus — but not required!
